{"nodes": [{"id": "aigen_backend_tasks_active_revert_manual_po_prd_gems_001", "label": "PRD-GEMS-001 Revert GEMS Manual PO Override", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "aigen-backend/tasks/active/REVERT-MANUAL-PO.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "aigen_backend_tasks_active_revert_manual_po_gems_manual_po_flow_flag", "label": "GEMS_MANUAL_PO_FLOW feature flag", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "The Manual PO pilot was built flag-gated with rollback in mind (\"Flag-aware, so the rollback restores today's behaviour\"), so the revert is a single config flip rather than code removal; the flag is env-var only, fail-closed to false, read once at process boot, and must be false in the app and the cron/sync runtimes.", "source_file": "aigen-backend/tasks/active/REVERT-MANUAL-PO.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "aigen_backend_tasks_active_revert_manual_po_waiting_manual_po_milestone", "label": "STATUS_MILESTONE.WAITING_MANUAL_PO = 26", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Deliberately permanent (RULE-009/MIG-002): QCF rows that entered milestone 26 during the pilot must keep rendering after rollback, so neither the status nor the pilot code paths may be deleted as \"dead code\".", "source_file": "aigen-backend/tasks/active/REVERT-MANUAL-PO.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "aigen_backend_tasks_active_revert_manual_po_sync_auto_po", "label": "syncAutoPO() SAP PO creation choke point", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "aigen-backend/tasks/active/REVERT-MANUAL-PO.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "aigen_backend_tasks_active_revert_manual_po_sap_failure_classifier", "label": "sapFailureClassifier.js (classifySapFailure)", "file_type": "co